            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Destabilizing Field"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, conjuration)\n\n40 feet. A creature that begins its turn within the area feels its body begin to stretch and must succeed at a 33 Fortitude save or become destabilized. A destabilized creature emits a 10-foot destabilizing field aura and becomes sickened 1. The destabilization ends when the creature is no longer sickened. A creature that succeeds at its saving throw against the aura is temporarily immune to all destabilizing fields for 1 minute."
